    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wu'yangu' wamwa Yetilo ku'mwa Mose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yetilo, muhozya wa V'amidiani, ise wu'kwi wamwa Mose, wigagwa mmola ya magambo gose ago Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuv'ezezizye Mose haki'mo na V'aizilaeli. Hangi' wigagwa i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyeni'lo Mose wasangwa wakamusu'v'ya muki' wakwe Zipola ku'mwa ise Yetilo, nawe Yetilo wamupokelaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'av'i'li' v'a ki'gosya. Lina lya mwana wa mbele witanagwe Geleshomu, ku'nguno Mose ndi' wayomba ati', “Nav'aga mugeni mwizi'li'zi mugati' na nsi' ya wu'geni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lina lya mwana wa wu'v'i'li' witanagwe Eliezeli, ku'nguno Mose ndi' wayomba ati', “Mulungu wamwa v'av'a wanne hu' mwene mugwasya wanne, na wampi'zizye na lu'panga lwamwa Falao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yetilo, ise wu'kwi wamwa Mose, haki'mo na muki' wamwa Mose na v'ana v'amwa Mose v'ose v'av'i'li', v'amuyi'laga Mose u'ko ku' ibalangu', u'ko wav'age atu'u'lile nkambi' ku' lu'gu'lu' lwamwa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yetilo watu'mi'zyaga nkombe ku'mwa Mose ku'yomba ati', “Ene Yetilo mukwiyo nizile ku' wako, haki'mo na muki' wako na v'ana v'ako v'av'i'li'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo Mose wafumaga ku'kamusu'mbi'la mukwiye, wamusungami'laga na ku'musu'na. V'igisi'li'zyaga na v'ingi'laga mu ihema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wamutentemuli'laga mukwiye magambo gose ago Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuv'ezezizye Falao na V'amisili ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli. Hangi' wamuwi'laga lu'duko u'lo v'alu'pandi'kile mu nzi'la, na i'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'age ali'v'api'zya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yetilo watogeziv'agwa muno ku'nguno ya wu'soga u'wo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'av'ezezizye V'aizilaeli, ku' ku'v'api'zya v'afume mu makono ga V'amisili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yetilo wayombaga ati', “Akumu'kiwe Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo wamupi'zizye ku'fuma mu makono ga V'amisili, haki'mo na makono gamwa Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' namanya ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' muhanya ku'ki'la milungu zyose, ku'nguno wav'akomolaga v'antu' v'enav'a ku'fuma mu makono ga V'amisili, av'o ndi' v'av'av'ezezyage V'aizilaeli mpazi'i'la.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yetilo, ise wu'kwi wamwa Mose, waletaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya haki'mo na vitaambo vingi' ku'mwa Mulungu. Nawe Aloni haki'mo na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli v'ose v'izaga ku'lya ki'liwa haki'mo na Yetilo, ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wangalu'ke ndiyu', Mose wikalaga ki'gele av'ayangu'le v'antu', na v'enav'o v'antu' v'i'maga na ku'muzyema Mose ku'fuma ndiyu' mpaka mpi'ndi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yetilo aho wawonaga gose ago Mose ali'v'av'ezezya v'antu' wayombaga ati', “Igambo ki' lyeni'li' i'lo u'li'v'av'ezezya v'antu'? Ku'nguno ev'e u'li'v'ayangu'la v'antu' v'enav'a winene, na v'antu' v'ose v'i'maga na ku'ku'zyema ku'fuma ndiyu' mpaka mpi'ndi'?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ku' mukwiye ati', “V'antu' v'ali'wiza ku' wanne ki'gele v'awu'zye ku'mwa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' v'ali' na igambo, v'ali'wiza ku' wanne nanne nu'v'ayangu'la mugati' ya yu'mo na mwiye, na ku'v'alagi'la nhama zyamwa Mulungu na nzi'la zya nhana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene mukwiye Yetilo wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Igambo lyeni'li' u'li'v'ezya li'kav'ile isoga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igambo lyeni'li' u'li'li'v'ezya, ev'e haki'mo na av'a v'antu', li'ku'v'a li'li'muzov'ya gele. U'kakowola ku'li'somba winene ku'nguno li'li' itimbu muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' u'degeleke wu'yangu' wanne, na Mulungu av'e haki'mo nanho. Yi'li'ku'dima ev'e ku'v'a u'li'ya ha mbele yamwa Mulungu ku'nguno ya v'antu', na ku'mufili'la Mulungu magambo gav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanho u'ku'v'a u'li'v'alagi'la nhama na nzi'la zya nhana zyamwa Mulungu, haki'mo na kikali'le na mili'mo i'zyo zili'koov'iwa ku'v'ezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ku'nguno ya magambo gangi', u'sogole mugati' na v'antu' v'ose, av'o v'amogohile Mulungu, v'a lole, na v'ayi'gayile nsawo ya ihongo. V'enav'o hu' u'v'ape wu'hanya wa madale ga v'antu' mavihu'mbi', magana, maku'mi atano na iku'mi iku'mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'v'atu'u'le v'enav'o v'av'e hu' v'ayangu'zi v'a v'antu' mugati' na nsiku' zyose. U'v'awi'le v'aku'letele mihayo milambu, sumbwa mido mido v'av'e v'ali'ziyangu'la v'eni'ki'li'. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' yi'ku'ku'v'ezya ku'v'a na muligo mudo, ku'nguno nav'o v'aku'somba muligo haki'mo nanho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' u'v'ezye vyeni'vi, na Mulungu u'lu' akoov'ile vyeni'vyo, hohene u'ku'kowola ku'lamba ku' muli'mo gwenu'gu', na v'antu' v'enav'a v'ose v'aku'v'a v'ali'su'v'a na ku'hola ki'la yu'mo ku' lu'go lwakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wadegelekaga wu'yangu' wa mukwiye, na wav'ezyaga vyose ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' wayangu'lagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wav'asogolaga v'antu' v'a wu'kowozi mugati' na V'aizilaeli v'ose, na ku'v'av'ezya v'av'e v'ahanya v'a madale ga v'antu' mavihu'mbi', magana, maku'mi atano na iku'mi iku'mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o v'av'ayangu'laga v'antu' nsiku' zyose. Mihayo mido mido v'ayangu'laga v'eni'ki'li'. Ali'vi mihayo milambu zyene v'amuletelaga Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo, Mose haki'mo na mukwiye v'idahyaga, nawe Yetilo wasu'v'aga ku' nsi' yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.27"
            ]
